---
title: Code review of one subtask
---
flowchart TD
    classDef human fill:#fff3cd,stroke:#8a6d3b,color:#000
    classDef role fill:#d9edf7,stroke:#31708f,color:#000
    classDef channel fill:#dff0d8,stroke:#3c763d,color:#000
    classDef stop fill:#eeeeee,stroke:#777,color:#000

    classDef gate fill:#f2dede,stroke:#a94442,color:#000

    START(["Coder stopped after a subtask.<br/>It stands at 👀 Review.<br/>Working tree uncommitted"]):::human
    CR["Code Reviewer — diff-level scope,<br/>one subtask's worth of change"]:::role

    C1["1. .claude/task.md:<br/>does the code do what the subtask said,<br/>including its 'how to test it'?"]
    C2["2. CLAUDE.md invariants first:<br/>log before page, latch ordering,<br/>one write guard per page per thread,<br/>all-zero pages valid, page-0 header logged,<br/>errors logged once at the engine boundary"]
    C3["3. CLAUDE.md conventions:<br/>sibling .MD per .rs, no comments in .rs,<br/>no allow or expect attributes in source,<br/>dependency edges, logging levels,<br/>no user data above DEBUG"]
    C4["4. Tests, read as carefully as the code:<br/>would this test pass without the change?<br/>deterministic? in tests/ unless the<br/>pure-private-function carve-out applies?"]
    C5["5. General Rust practice for this stack"]
    C6["6. Was the full gate actually run?"]

    FOUND{"Any finding?"}
    BACKTO["Set the subtask back to 🚧 In Progress.<br/>The same subtask gets finished, rather than<br/>its defects becoming new work"]
    SETDONE["Set the subtask ✅ Done in .claude/task.md.<br/>Only this role sets it, and only here"]:::gate
    BUGS[".claude/problems.md — append one entry:<br/>P-n from the 'Next entry:' line,<br/>Created by: Code Reviewer, Reason,<br/>Description, How to prevent in future.<br/>Prevention is a lint, a test or a CI step,<br/>never 'be careful next time'.<br/>It is read once and deleted when scheduled,<br/>so it must stand on its own"]:::channel
    BACK(["Coder finishes the same subtask;<br/>preventions the entries name are<br/>scheduled separately<br/>— see agent-flow-problem-lifecycle.mmd"]):::stop

    OK["Say so plainly. Write nothing to problems.md"]
    HUMAN["Human reviews and commits"]:::human
    MORE{"Subtasks left in the Order Plan?"}
    NEXTSUB(["Coder takes the next subtask"]):::stop
    MSREVIEW(["Milestone Reviewer<br/>— see agent-flow-milestone-review.mmd"]):::stop

    START --> CR --> C1 --> C2 --> C3 --> C4 --> C5 --> C6 --> FOUND
    FOUND -- yes --> BUGS --> BACKTO --> BACK
    FOUND -- no --> SETDONE --> OK --> HUMAN --> MORE
    MORE -- yes --> NEXTSUB
    MORE -- no --> MSREVIEW